EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Is it just me, or does shopping
make you hungry too,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bana mı öyle geliyor, yoksa alışveriş
