{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Man, I ended up buying something
that I didn't even come in here for,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ay, al final he acabado comprando
algo que ni siquiera necesitaba,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Oh... {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}J'ai encore craqué et acheté
